8302.d:
My digital images are derived from the search for a pure mathematical abstract form composed with surprising harmony. 

The program generates blurring and shifting a distributions of the input image pixels changed with alternator depend on a 6 numbers given by the hash. The number of 147,456 possible animations increases to 79,164,837,199,872 after multiplying it by possible displacements of a one pixel from the white square input image contour.

Feature explanation:

Multiplier: determines the shape of the fractal. The probability decreases with the value from the set {0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2, …, 511.5} 
Fractal: defines if the multiplier is a power of two
Fraction: defines if the multiplier is a natural number or a natural number + ½
Angle: {-45°, 0°, 45°}
Side: {left, right}
Direction: {left, right}
Density: {1, 0.5}
Alternator module: every which value of the input image tones is changed to 0 {2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7}

Proembrion

